* UPDATES:
*
* VERSION 1.1 : PSpice model release with following updates
*               (a) Stripped off all unused SUBCKT definitions and 
*                   MODEL statements
*			    (b) Moved GLOBAL definitions of PARAM and MODEL statements into
*                   each applicable SUBCKT definitions
*               (c) All SUBCKT has _INA149 as unique name qualifications
*
